for the sake of analysis, if we assume that 'right-skewed' is being used loosely to mean 'has a chance of large loss', then Lottery B might be considered more aligned with that idea, though this contradicts the definition. Still, the reason cannot clearly be applied to prefer one lottery over the other based on the provided definition.",
